OL,12,     GThe UK premiere of Pulitzer-prize-
OL,13,     Gwinning opera Angel's Bone from
OL,14,     GManchester's Aviva Studios.
OL,15,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,16,     GWith the FIFA World Cup set to
OL,17,     Glaunch, Lopa Kothari picks music
OL,18,     Gthat celebrates the beautiful
OL,19,     Ggame. Also, Mexican Institute of
OL,20,     GSound shares three tracks that
OL,21,     Ginform his new album.
